    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world powered by clockwork, a new form of technology was discovered, BIOS. It is alive, it feels, and it has a mind of its own. You follow Arka, an experiment forced to merge with a Bio creature named Ray. She sets out to learn more about the power of Bio, and the cost it may have on humanity.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodecapunk is a deck-building RPG game, where you control and manage up to 6 people in combat. You utilize their abilities, cards, and unique stats to overcome any obstacle.</p>",
